      "explanation": "a = 3, d = 5. Let a_n = 78.\na_n = a + (n - 1)d\n78 = 3 + (n - 1)5\n75 = (n - 1)5\n15 = n - 1\nn = 16. So, the 16th term is 78.",
      "explanation_hi": "a = 3, d = 5. मान लें a_n = 78.\na_n = a + (n - 1)d\n78 = 3 + (n - 1)5\n75 = (n - 1)5\n15 = n - 1\nn = 16. इसलिए, 16वाँ पद 78 है।",
