      "explanation": "First 3-digit number divisible by 7 is 105. The last is 994. \nHere a = 105, d = 7, a_n = 994.\n994 = 105 + (n - 1)7\n889 = (n - 1)7\n127 = n - 1\nn = 128.",
      "explanation_hi": "7 से विभाज्य पहली 3-अंकीय संख्या 105 है। अंतिम 994 है।\nयहाँ a = 105, d = 7, a_n = 994.\n994 = 105 + (n - 1)7\n889 = (n - 1)7\n127 = n - 1\nn = 128.",
